# L §5.14.1 / §8.4 RUN-FUTURE: "<decision> on <d> reads <x> at <d'> after its day (a running read ... reached through
# a computed day)": sweep on day 5 reads bal(konto, day_of(m, look)) with look = 20.
# Own reality: konto opens at 5 000.00 PLN, savings at 0; amt = 1 000.00 PLN, dom = 5.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input look: int
move sweep[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto, day_of(m, look)) - amt)

version look_v
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  look = 20 "own"

ask q: bal(savings, 2026-03-31)

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 1 000.00 PLN "own"
  dom = 5 "own"
  opening[konto] = 5 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== expect
q: refused: RUN-FUTURE a decision on 2026-01-05 reads konto at 2026-01-20 after its day
  cut 2026-10-20
